<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>DZAIR GAMES | شحن الألعاب</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif;
            background: #07111f;
            color: white;
        }

        /* HEADER */
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #07111f, #0d2438);
            padding: 20px 6%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff7a00;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: white;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-right: 25px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ff7a00;
        }

        /* HERO */
        .hero {
            min-height: 390px;
            padding: 70px 6%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 30%, rgba(255,122,0,0.20), transparent 35%),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #07111f, #102b42);
        }

        .hero-text {
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #ff7a00;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #ff7a00;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .hero-btn:hover {
            background: #ff941f;
        }

        /* GAMES */
        .games-section {
            padding: 60px 6%;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 34px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .games {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .game-card {
            background: #0d1b2a;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 18px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
        }

        .game-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            border-color: #ff7a00;
        }

        .game-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 210px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .game-info {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .game-info h3 {
            font-size: 23px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .game-info p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .charge-btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            background: #ff7a00;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .charge-btn:hover {
            background: #ff941f;
        }

        /* WHY US */
        .features {
            padding: 40px 6% 70px;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .feature {
            background: #0d1b2a;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .feature h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .feature p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background: #050b13;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
        }

        footer strong {
            color: #ff7a00;
        }

        /* MOBILE */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .games {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }

            .hero {
                text-align: center;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 38px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 15px;
            }

            nav a {
                margin: 0 8px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 55px 20px;
            }

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            .hero p {
                font-size: 17px;
            }

            .games-section {
                padding: 45px 15px;
            }

            .games {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .feature-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .game-image {
                height: 220px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo">
            DZAIR <span>GAMES</span>
        </div>

        <nav>
            <a href="#home">الرئيسية</a>
            <a href="#games">الألعاب</a>
            <a href="#contact">تواصل معنا</a>
        </nav>
    </header>


    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">

        <div class="hero-text">
            <h1>
                اشحن ألعابك مع
                <span>DZAIR GAMES</span>
            </h1>

            <p>
                شحن سريع وآمن لأشهر ألعاب الهاتف.
                اختر لعبتك وابدأ عملية الشحن بسهولة.
            </p>

            <a href="#games" class="hero-btn">
                ابدأ الشحن الآن
            </a>
        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- GAMES -->
    <section class="games-section" id="games">

        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>اختر لعبتك</h2>
            <p>نوفر لك شحن الألعاب التي تحتاجها</p>
        </div>

        <div class="games">

            <!-- FREE FIRE -->
            <div class="game-card">

                <img
                    src="freefire.jpg"
                    alt="Free Fire"
                    class="game-image"
                >

                <div class="game-info">
                    <h3>Free Fire</h3>

                    <p>
                        شحن الجواهر بسرعة
                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="charge-btn">
                        اشحن الآن
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- PUBG -->
            <div class="game-card">

                <img
                    src="pubg.jpg"
                    alt="PUBG Mobile"
                    class="game-image"
                >

                <div class="game-info">
                    <h3>PUBG Mobile</h3>

                    <p>
                        شحن UC بسهولة
                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="charge-btn">
                        اشحن الآن
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- EFOOTBALL -->
            <div class="game-card">

                <img
                    src="efootballg.jpg"
                    alt="eFootball"
                    class="game-image"
                >

                <div class="game-info">
                    <h3>eFootball</h3>

                    <p>
                        شحن العملات والرصيد
                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="charge-btn">
                        اشحن الآن
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- FC MOBILE -->
            <div class="game-card">

                <img
                    src="fc.jpg"
                    alt="FC Mobile"
                    class="game-image"
                >

                <div class="game-info">
                    <h3>FC Mobile</h3>

                    <p>
                        شحن FC Points
                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="charge-btn">
                        اشحن الآن
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- FEATURES -->
    <section class="features">

        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>لماذا DZAIR GAMES؟</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">

            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
                <h3>شحن سريع</h3>
                <p>
                    معالجة طلبات الشحن بسرعة.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
                <h3>آمن وموثوق</h3>
                <p>
                    نهتم بأمان طلباتك ومعلوماتك.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
                <h3>دعم العملاء</h3>
                <p>
                    تواصل معنا عند الحاجة للمساعدة.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

    </section>


    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer id="contact">

        <p>
            © 2026 <strong>DZAIR GAMES</strong> -
            جميع الحقوق محفوظة
        </p>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
